  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:wangziyi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:wangziyi:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_D">王咨議</persName>大好事，問中國人物及風土所生，終無極已。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:fourthson" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:fourthson:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_D">肅之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:fourthson:m0003" ref="326_faf_cd3_D">幼恭</persName>，右將軍<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin080-xizhi:fourthson:m0009" ref="326_faf_cd3">羲之</persName>第四子。歷中書郎、驃騎咨議。</p>
